repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2937504578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107101#issuecomment-2937504578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107101","id":2937504578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vFsNC","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T22:40:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T22:41:41Z","body":"> The handle is created by an SVG sprite, and the current highlighting logic is trying to apply a blue mask on top. Would it be helpful to use an alpha of `0.75` for non-hovered and `1.0` for hovered without applying the blue mask at all?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure why the blue mask was being applied in the first place. Modulating colored icons usually doesn't look great; instead, it looks best when the icon is grayscale.\r\n\r\nWe may want to use grayscale handle icons in the long run so they can be tinted more appropriately (e.g. each handle representing a X/Y/Z axis can use a different color), but that should be left for later. I made a proof of concept for this a while ago: https://github.com/Calinou/godot/tree/3d-editor-gizmos-add-per-handle-colors","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2937504578/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2938177553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107101#issuecomment-2938177553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107101","id":2938177553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vIQgR","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-04T02:56:18Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T02:56:18Z","body":"I think this is ok 👍. It's not a big change that we need to block it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2938177553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2938226566","html_u